<em>Bloomberg</em>'s Mark Gurman today <a href="https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-09-30/apple-is-finally-ready-to-enter-its-next-big-category-the-smart-home">briefly mentioned</a> that "Apple aims to eventually update its larger HomePod," assuring that the company remains committed to the full-sized speaker, which was <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/2021/03/12/apple-discontinuing-homepod/">discontinued in 2021</a> and <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/2023/01/18/apple-announces-new-homepod/">reintroduced in 2023</a>.<br/>
<br/>
